; claude: a software synthesizer, from scratch, for teaching digital
; audio and signal processing: one idea per module, each .mli with its
; diagram, worked example and references (see
; docs/claude_notes/plan_audio_teaching.md and notes_audio.md).
; Independent of the Playground (playground/Audio.ml is the adapter).
; A private library, installed as part of elm_playground: pure OCaml,
; so every backend, the web one included, can use it.
(library
 (name audio)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
)
